import greenwood as gw

lung = gw.load_dataset("lung")
death = gw.Outcome.surv(time="time", event="status")

y = death.bind(lung)
y
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=11}
```
Surv(type=right, n=228, events=165)
```
:::
:::


